  "details": "1. Grab a physbone\n\n2. Move it, it syncs fine\n\n3. Pose it, it'll go to the \"ungrabbed\"/initial state momentarily before posing\n\nThis only occurs if a remote player poses it. All players will see the pose \"jump\". If a player poses a physbone on their own avatar, this does not happen.\n\nThis also occurs on open beta 1932",
